  "specification": {
    "frameId": "70971:200121",
    "version": "v2.3.2607A",
    "selectedRuleTexts": [
      {
        "nodeId": "70971:200523",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "text": "所有类型的对话框圆角为 8px，且出现时，底部含黑色透明遮罩（#000000，30%），以下仅为样式展示，非标准尺寸",
        "ancestors": [
          {
            "id": "70971:200121",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200207",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200434",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200519",
            "type": "FRAME"
          }
        ],
        "role": "selected-normative-body-text",
        "interpretation": "Saved specification declaration only; not a component identity or automatic variant approval."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "70971:200234",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "text": "对话框宽度根据内容不同，分为特殊尺寸（380px）、小尺寸（480px）、特殊场景（650px）、大尺寸（750px）四种宽度",
        "ancestors": [
          {
            "id": "70971:200121",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200207",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200208",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200230",
            "type": "FRAME"
          }
        ],
        "role": "selected-normative-body-text",
        "interpretation": "Saved specification declaration only; not a component identity or automatic variant approval."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "70971:200531",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "text": "常规情况下对话框头部由 信息图标、标题、关闭按钮 三种元素组成，特殊情况下，头部可添加步骤条等其他元素。\n其中「标题」、「信息图标」、「步骤条」等都为非必选元素，「关闭按钮」为必选元素。",
        "ancestors": [
          {
            "id": "70971:200121",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200207",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200526",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200527",
            "type": "FRAME"
          }
        ],
        "role": "selected-normative-body-text",
        "interpretation": "Saved specification declaration only; not a component identity or automatic variant approval."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "70971:200404",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "text": "对话框的内容区可包含文字描述、表单、列表、步骤条等元素，以下只定义内容结构在有无标题时的通用变量区别。\n内容区🧍‍♂具体规范详见该组件规范，例：表单详见「全站表单规范」。",
        "ancestors": [
          {
            "id": "70971:200121",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200207",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200402",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200403",
            "type": "FRAME"
          }
        ],
        "role": "selected-normative-body-text",
        "interpretation": "Saved specification declaration only; not a component identity or automatic variant approval."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "70971:200426",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "text": "常规情况下，对话框的底部可包含形状按钮、文字按钮。定制文本等描述文字不属于对话框底部范畴。",
        "ancestors": [
          {
            "id": "70971:200121",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200207",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200412",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200425",
            "type": "FRAME"
          }
        ],
        "role": "selected-normative-body-text",
        "interpretation": "Saved specification declaration only; not a component identity or automatic variant approval."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "70971:202294/68908:205290",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "text": "标题：18px/Semibold/#19191A\n关闭 icon：20*20px；背景 18*18px\n信息 icon：20*20px",
        "ancestors": [
          {
            "id": "70971:200121",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200207",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200526",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200534",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200535",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:202294",
            "type": "INSTANCE"
          }
        ],
        "role": "selected-normative-body-text",
        "interpretation": "Saved specification declaration only; not a component identity or automatic variant approval."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "70971:200670",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "text": "❶ 点击对话框右上角关闭按钮；❷ 点击次要按钮“Cancel”；❸ 按下键盘“ESC”；❹ 点击对话框之外空白区域",
        "ancestors": [
          {
            "id": "70971:200121",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200653",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200654",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200662",
            "type": "FRAME"
          }
        ],
        "role": "selected-normative-body-text",
        "interpretation": "Saved specification declaration only; not a component identity or automatic variant approval."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "70971:200663",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "text": "黑色蒙层的点击 ：普通信息展示的对话框可通过点击黑色蒙层来关闭对话框，但若是信息录入的对话框，不建议点击黑色蒙层关闭对话框，容易造成已填写数据的丢失。",
        "ancestors": [
          {
            "id": "70971:200121",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200653",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200654",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200662",
            "type": "FRAME"
          }
        ],
        "role": "selected-normative-body-text",
        "interpretation": "Saved specification declaration only; not a component identity or automatic variant approval."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "70971:200128",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "text": "对话框头部标题文案超出时，需换行处理，关闭按钮与第一行文字保持对齐，而不是固定一行超出省略标题。",
        "ancestors": [
          {
            "id": "70971:200121",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200122",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200123",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200124",
            "type": "FRAME"
          }
        ],
        "role": "selected-normative-body-text",
        "interpretation": "Saved specification declaration only; not a component identity or automatic variant approval."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "70971:200175",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "text": "对话框高度默认为适应值，而最大高度为屏幕高度减去「上限制区域（ 64px）+下限制区域高度 （64px）」；\n当对话框高度未达到最大值时，对话框垂直增长，当达到最大高度时，需保证固定头部+底部（操作区）完全展示的基础上，内容区域出现滚动条，滚动查看内容。",
        "ancestors": [
          {
            "id": "70971:200121",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200122",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200173",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200174",
            "type": "FRAME"
          }
        ],
        "role": "selected-normative-body-text",
        "interpretation": "Saved specification declaration only; not a component identity or automatic variant approval."
      },
      {
        "nodeId": "70971:200154",
        "type": "TEXT",
        "text": "对话框的位置在页面内始终居中展示，而不是居上展示",
        "ancestors": [
          {
            "id": "70971:200121",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200122",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200149",
            "type": "FRAME"
          },
          {
            "id": "70971:200150",
            "type": "FRAME"
          }
        ],
        "role": "selected-normative-body-text",
        "interpretation": "Saved specification declaration only; not a component identity or automatic variant approval."
      }
    ],
    "completeSpecificationIndexed": false
  },
